## Performance Components

### OptimizedWidget
Prevents unnecessary rebuilds:

```dart
OptimizedWidget(
  child: ExpensiveWidget(),
  shouldRebuild: (oldWidget, newWidget) {
    return oldWidget.data != newWidget.data;
  },
)
```

### MemoizedWidget
Caches expensive computations:

```dart
MemoizedWidget(
  builder: (context) => ExpensiveComputation(),
  dependencies: [data1, data2],
)
```

### InteractiveWrapper
Haptic feedback and animations:

```dart
InteractiveWrapper(
  onTap: () => handleTap(),
  child: Container(
    child: Text('Tap me'),
  ),
)
```

